        "description": "Felix D\u00f6rre discovered that coTURN response buffer is not initialized properly. An attacker could possibly use this issue to obtain sensitive information. (CVE-2020-4067)  It was discovered that coTURN web server incorrectly handled HTTP POST requests. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a denial of service, obtain sensitive information or other unspecified impact. (CVE-2020-6061, CVE-2020-6062)",
